/**

  @page install_linux Building %OpenMS on GNU/Linux

  %OpenMS obtains its dependencies through vcpkg on every platform, so the build
  instructions are shared: see @ref install_vcpkg for the system prerequisites,
  the GCC/Clang versions required, and the configure/build/test commands. The
  Linux-specific notes are below. To build against the distribution's packages
  instead of vcpkg, configure without a preset (see @ref install_vcpkg_without).

  @section install_linux_testing_openms Testing the OpenMS/TOPP Installation

  \include{doc} "../doxygen/install/install-testing-openms.doxygen"

  The graphical tools (TOPPView, TOPPAS, INIFileEditor) are not part of this source tree; see
  <a href="https://github.com/OpenMS/OpenMS-TOPP-GUI">OpenMS-TOPP-GUI</a> for building them and for
  Qt-related issues.

*/
